  "historyNote": "#7759, eff 9-7-02, EXPIRED: 9-7-10 New. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16 New. #12040, eff 11-10-16; ss by #14594, eff 7-20-26, EXPIRES: 7-20-36",
